nodecode-listing-automater is a rewrite of Summertimechi's Summertimechi/listing-automater-skill:

  https://github.com/Summertimechi/listing-automater-skill
  commit d751b49e5d849f2967d2f5281d23400098b0e718
  MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 NeoAsis (LICENSE)

The original is a skill-only plugin: an __init__.py whose one register() call
adds skills/listing-automater/SKILL.md to the agent as a read-only skill, and a
plugin.yaml declaring no tools, hooks or environment variables. Rewritten here:
that SKILL.md is one prose define-skill, its frontmatter description the
sentence the index lists and its whole body kept as comment lines, so
(help 'listing-automater) reads the guidance as the author wrote it and nothing
is evaluated.

Left out: the plugin's registration shim (a knowledge cell has nothing to
start, and the index reads the skill from its file), and the repository README's
npx install line, which installs the plugin for another harness. Nothing else of
the original is missing: the skill has no companion files.
